 ## Scope
 
+Under Countable Choice ([[def-countable-choice]]), [[lem-tdmath-diagonal-self-adjointness]] proves that this exact operator, including its displayed domain, is self-adjoint in the sense of the Hilbert-space adjoint. Completeness, the linear domain and its density are supplied separately by the first well-definedness lemma; no choice assumption is needed for that coefficient-space construction.
+
 The definition introduces no claim about a physical Hamiltonian or about a trace of $e^{-\beta H_E}$.
